  "description": "crew-chief: routing policy at session start; read-only guard for the scanner, deep-reader, and reviewer agents; solo mode enforcement; update notices; agent panel row installer; skill hints and a one-time skill offer; per-subagent progress for the panel row; limit-aware token saver and compact flow (mod); after a compaction, the pinned constraints and open tasks are put back from the handoff files",
  "modules": [
